{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36896","headline":"贵池晓望 · 罗隐","name":"贵池晓望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"稂莠参天剪未平，且乘孤櫂且行行。\n计疎狡兔无三窟，羁甚宾鸿欲一生。\n合眼亦知非本意，伤心其奈是多情。\n前溪好泊谁爲主，昨夜沙禽占月明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}